      "sentence_id": 4,
      "text": "IN THE HIGH COURT OF KERALA AT ERNAKULAM  PRESENT  THE HONOURABLE MR. JUSTICE DEVAN RAMACHANDRAN  &\n THE HONOURABLE MRS. JUSTICE M.B. SNEHALATHA  Monday, the 30th day of September 2024 / 8th Aswina, 1946  MAT.APPEAL NO. 996 OF 2019  OP 687/2018 OF FAMILY COURT,THRISSUR NAME & ADDRESS OF THE APPELLANT/PETITIONER:\n DR.NEVIN C.G., AGED 38 YEARS, S/O.GOPI C.S., CHERUVATHERY HOUSE,\n P.O.CHOVVUR, CHOVVUR VILLAGE, CHOVVUR DESOM, THRISSUR TALUK,\n THRISSUR DISTRICT, PIN - 680 027.\n BY ADVS.M/S.BABU KARUKAPADATH, M.A.VAHEEDA BABU, P.U.VINOD  KUMAR, AVINASH P RAVEENDRAN, ARYA RAGHUNATH AND KADIJA JASMINE NAME & ADDRESS OF THE RESPONDENT/RESPONDENT:\n RESHMA K.R., AGED 30 YEARS, D/O.RAMAKRISHNAN, KOLANGATTUKARA HOUSE,\n P.O.CHOOLISSERY, KOLANGATTUKARA DESOM, CHOOLISSERY VILLAGE, THRISSUR  TALUK, THRISSUR DISTRICT.",
