    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "This Matrimonial Appeal having come up for Orders on 30.09.2024 along with Mat.Appeal 965, 992 & 1047 of 2019, the court on the same day passed the following:\n p.t.o.\n DEVAN RAMACHANDRAN & M.B. SNEHALATHA, JJ.\n ==============================\n Mat. Appeal Nos.965, 992, 996 and 1047 of 2019  ==========================\n Dated this the 30th day of September, 2024  ORDER Devan Ramachandran, J.\nDr.Nevin C.G. is present before us, while Smt.Reshma K.R. is not, and her learned counsel explains that she has been unable to because of her bereavement in her family.\nDr.Nevin.C.G vs Reshma K.R on 30 September, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/19347587/\n1",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 963,
      "end": 1629,
